%% Phase1 / post / MV3-G03b 合并转发（聊天记录卡）
%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/angular/visual/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/post/mv3-g03b/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/components/chat-content/chat-content-base.component.ts::forwardMessage（:1425-1461，mode='merge'）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant PS as Pending or local state
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员多选消息选「合并转发」，目标群收到一条「聊天记录」卡片，点开可看到全部原消息
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=implemented；helix=full；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: relayMessages(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_relay_messages", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_relay_messages", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_relay_messages", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 把选中消息合并成一张聊天记录卡转发 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/createPosts
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: WS authority event or canonical result
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction message + channel + viewer member + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（postReceived，POST，channelUpdateByPost，UPDATE_CHANNEL）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ raw event → Angular projection
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：转发者在目标频道 unreadCount 绝对归零；目标频道其它可见成员 getMemberUnread(channelId,userId).unreadCount 各 +1（merge 模式每目标只 1 条 MULTIPLY，故恒 +1；独立计算，禁止复制转发者数值）。已修（原为缺口）：relayMessages merge 分支每目标频道 push 单条 MULTIPLY 时调 applySendUnread（mockImGate.service.ts::relayMessages）；MULTIPLY 消息 readBits 长度 = 目标频道 members.length，转发者位 = '1'；接收者位在其 postRead 之前恒 '0'
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：旧本地 MergeForwardStrategy.buildForwardResult + sendRelayMessages 已退场（strategy 文件为死代码），不得再走该路径；dialog-item 摘要固定「转发：聊天记录」，不得取源消息正文（否则泄漏被合并消息内容到会话列表）；前端不得乐观插入合并卡（id 由实现侧生成）
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：postReceived，POST，channelUpdateByPost，UPDATE_CHANNEL；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
